   "widgets_values": [
    "## A29 (e): evaluate decoded HDR against ground truth\n\nTwo **Load EXR Sequence** nodes: the TRUE linear HDR (e.g. the EXR clip the SDR was made from) and the pipeline's\ndecoded HDR (the (a) output folder, e.g. hdr/exr/h3_hdr_00001 under output/). **H3 HDR Eval Report** prints the stop\nerror per luminance band (mean, p99, bias), worst channel, an 8-bit baseline and code-domain PSNR.\nUse the bias column to edit Bias Correct's table."
   ]
